 The operation only works for the operands are vectors.
 
 @smallexample
 for (i = 0; i < GET_MODE_NUNITS (@var{m}); i++)
-  op0[i] = (i < ops[5] + ops[6] && op1[i]
+  op0[i] = (i < ops[5] - ops[6] && op1[i]
